# Derenzo phantom source for digimouse
#
# 6 sectors of cylindrical rod sources arranged in the X-Z plane,
# all running parallel to the Y axis (long axis of the mouse).
# Rods are centred at Y=18mm and span Y=[6,30]mm -- the torso
# region where the body is consistently >= 12mm wide in X.
# All rod centres verified to be inside non-air tissue across their
# full Y extent at Z=0 (central Z slice).
#
# Sector layout (rod diameter -> X sector centre):
#   d=1.0mm: X=-10mm   d=1.5mm: X=-6mm   d=2.0mm: X=-2mm
#   d=2.5mm: X=+2mm    d=3.0mm: X=+6mm   d=4.0mm: X=+10mm
#
# Total rods: 65

# --- d=1.0mm rods (12 rods) ---
/gate/source/addSource rod0 gps
/gate/source/rod0/gps/particle gamma
/gate/source/rod0/gps/ene/type Mono
/gate/source/rod0/gps/ene/mono 140.0 keV
/gate/source/rod0/gps/pos/type Volume
/gate/source/rod0/gps/pos/shape Cylinder
/gate/source/rod0/gps/pos/radius 0.5 mm
/gate/source/rod0/gps/pos/halfz 12.0 mm
# Rod axis is Y -- rotate the GPS cylinder (default axis Z) to point along Y
/gate/source/rod0/gps/pos/rot1 1 0 0
/gate/source/rod0/gps/pos/rot2 0 0 1
/gate/source/rod0/gps/pos/centre -12.0 18.0 -3.464 mm
/gate/source/rod0/gps/ang/type iso
/gate/source/rod0/setActivity 0.00000154 Ci

